/-!
# Round six, item language (I3): the entry procedure of the uniform Proposition 14

`p14CH jZ = dIn ; mainCH jZ ; dOut` (the frozen descriptor moves of `KFWC15`).

**`p14QH`**: on `encK st f` with the descriptor `[P, K, D, S, ρ, r, p, w, Z]` on stack `36`, the
array on stack `0` and the stacks `1 … 49` (but `36`) empty, `p14CH jZ` leaves
`gflat zs* ++ l` on stack `0` and restores every other stack.
-/

set_option linter.unusedSimpArgs false
